{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10413050","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10413050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041305001:1":{"text":"昔、こんな言葉を聞いたことがあります。「星空には、人々の運命が隠れている」と。","source_cn":"我曾听过一句话，“星空中藏着每个人的命运”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x962AE2B2FF7D8F31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041305002:1":{"text":"この澄み渡った星々の輝きこそ……私たちの運命や過去、現在や未来を示す、星の導きなのです。","source_cn":"那些清澈的、闪烁着的星辰辉光——这就是星星的指引，昭示...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DE89FD917BB7FB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041305003:1":{"text":"ロンロンにはよく分からないですけど、星の導きが分かるなんて、ライカさんはすごいです！","source_cn":"满满听不太懂，但是莱卡能看懂星星的指引，很厉害呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03AB3CDFFBBECF4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041305004:0":{"text":"実は……完全に理解してるとは言えないんです。でも子どもの頃から、時折木陰の隙間から漏れる星の光に、引き寄せられていました。","source_cn":"其实……也谈不上完全了解，但我从小就被偶尔从树荫中漏出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x023ECB9A24B3C8F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041305005:0":{"text":"空の上には何があるのでしょう？なぜ星は遥か遠くで輝いてるのでしょう？そして、その星の導きを辿っていけば、迷える旅人は本当に進むべき方向を見つけられるのでしょうか？","source_cn":"天幕上到底有什么呢？星星为什么会在那么遥远的地方闪耀呢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF3994A56171FC6E","variant_status":"","male":"","fe